Subject: [PATCH 1/2] radv/video: remove decode tier3

tier2 and tier3 reference layouts are incompatible, causing corruption
in cases with mixed usage. No infallible tell exists to know which mode
will be used at a particular moment when both are advertised. Remove
tier3 support, leaving all capable chips on tier2 as before.

Fixes: f78222dc29c ("radv/video: Add support for decode tier3")
Generated-by: Claude Code (Claude Opus 5.5)
---
